! Store-close-to-fetch look-ahead test (the hazard the FP sign-modifier
! codesign exposed, plan stage 3a note). A load whose operand word was
! written by an immediately preceding store must read the new value,
! not the stale one. Before the fix, L(N),X below read X's initial 0.
!   L(N),THREE  : acc = 3.0
!   ST(N),X     : X = 3.0
!   L(N),X      : acc = 3.0  (reads the just-stored word -- the hazard)
!   ST(N),R     : R = 3.0
START   L(N), THREE
        ST(N), X
        L(N), X
        ST(N), R
DONE    BEW, $
        CNOP
THREE   DD(BU,64), 0
X       DD(BU,64), 0
R       DD(BU,64), 0
        END, START
